       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MORPHOLOGICAL-GEODESICS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MORPHOLOGICAL-GEODESIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-STREAMLINE-FLOW-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GEODESIC-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MORPHOLOGICAL-SEAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MORPHOLOGICAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GEO-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GEO-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FLOW-AND-WAVELET.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CURVATURE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GEO-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FLOW-AND-WAVELET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STREAMLINE-FLOW-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CURVATURE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GEODESIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GEO-PROOFS.
           IF WS-STREAMLINE-FLOW-OK = 1 AND
              WS-WAVELET-DECOMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GEODESIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MORPHOLOGICAL-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GEO-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GEO-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GEO-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GEO-CODE.
